# __NAME__

Python workspace using the `__NAMESPACE__` namespace.

```bash
uv sync --all-packages
uv run inv check
uv run inv test.all
```

Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) and
[RTK](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk) first. Use `--no-rtk` on development tasks when
RTK is unavailable or complete raw diagnostics are needed.

Start with [development](docs/development/README.md), [architecture](docs/architecture.md),
and [testing](docs/testing.md). Commit `uv.lock` after the first sync.
